  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Transparency and Accountability in Public Financial Management System in Vietnam (STRENGTH)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall Objective: To enhance budget transparency and accountability in Vietnam. Outcome 1: Citizens, CBOs and CSOs increase engagement and feedback in State budget Process and public investment projects. Outcome 2: Mechanisms for government-civil society collaboration and dialogue on PFM related issues are institutionalised and effectively implemented.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
